WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,560 --> 00:00:08,370
Boy, be quiet and don’t forget the rules.

2
00:00:09,030 --> 00:00:13,070
Now you two can see clearly, right? You can see clearly. Then what?

3
00:00:16,740 --> 00:00:19,140
Can you open the door for me and let me in? Sorry?

4
00:00:19,540 --> 00:00:20,780
We two don't have that right

5
00:00:21,140 --> 00:00:22,620
The two of us are just patrolling

6
00:00:22,740 --> 00:00:23,660
Not responsible for opening the door

7
00:00:23,860 --> 00:00:25,260
Let me tell you by the way

8
00:00:25,580 --> 00:00:27,700
The two soldiers guarding the gate because the weather was too hot

9
00:00:27,700 --> 00:00:29,180
The world has been sent to rest

10
00:00:29,660 --> 00:00:31,340
The time until the next batch of room changes

11
00:00:31,340 --> 00:00:33,620
There are still three hours so

12
00:00:33,900 --> 00:00:36,980
You can either wait three hours now or

13
00:00:37,340 --> 00:00:38,700
Just open the door and come in by yourself

14
00:00:39,570 --> 00:00:41,010
What does it mean to open the door yourself?

15
00:00:41,700 --> 00:00:42,660
This city gate

16
00:00:42,820 --> 00:00:45,740
It opens upward to open the door

17
00:00:46,020 --> 00:00:48,980
Either use internal mechanisms to pull it or

18
00:00:49,300 --> 00:00:51,380
Just use brute force to lift him up

19
00:00:54,290 --> 00:00:55,850
Is this recruit a fool?

20
00:00:56,010 --> 00:00:58,970
He really wants to go to Taicheng Gate. I want to know.

21
00:00:59,170 --> 00:01:01,930
Just go and see it, yes, yes, go and see it

22
00:01:02,330 --> 00:01:03,610
If he really wants to build a city gate

23
00:01:03,810 --> 00:01:05,370
I really want to laugh at him
